{'symbol': 'ACN', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Accenture Launches myNav, Cloud Platform to Help Enterprises Navigate the Cloud Landscape', 'text': 'Accenture launched myNav, a cloud platform that helps organizations design and simulate different cloud solutions to identify the ones that best fit their specific business requirements. Identifying the right cloud solution can be complicated, as there are multiple cloud providers and cloud models, including public, private, multi and hybrid. Further, many companies spend significant time and money migrating applications and data centers to the cloud only to find that the applications don’t always operate optimally. Accenture research shows that nearly two-thirds of companies are not seeing the expected benefits from their cloud migration initiatives. myNav evaluates multiple variables — including an organization’s technology infrastructure, applications, data, operational model and business outcomes — to identify the right solution for enterprises, then simulates it at scale to confirm its viability and refine the business case. By providing a customized roadmap, myNav enables organizations to maximize the return on their current and future cloud technology investments. For example, myNav recommends the application transformation approach for clients to accelerate their innovation in the cloud. myNav provides a recommended cloud target through a three-step process: Scanning and assessing the client’s existing infrastructure, application and data landscape and recommending the most appropriate cloud architecture and solution; Using an automated artificial intelligence (AI) engine to interact with Accenture’s library of collective cloud expertise and recommend an enterprise architecture and solution; and Simulating and testing the scaled-up model of the client’s recommended cloud solution to identify the value and help build the business case for an optimal solution for their business requirements. Unique in the market, myNav is the only platform that enables organizations to discover, assess, design and simulate end-to-end cloud solutions at scale.'}{'symbol': 'APD', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Air Products Declares Quarterly Dividend, Payable on February 10, 2020', 'text': 'The Board of Directors of Air Products declared a quarterly dividend of $1.16 per share of common stock. The dividend is payable on February 10, 2020 to shareholders of record at the close of business on January 2, 2020.'}{'symbol': 'ALGN', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Align Technology Appoints Frank Quinn to Vice President and General Manager, United States', 'text': 'Align Technology, Inc. announced that Frank Quinn, vice president, Marketing, Americas, will move to the role of vice president and general manager of the United States. The new role takes effect on December 9, 2019. In this new role, Mr. Quinn will be responsible for driving continued growth and profitability within the United States, overseeing the US Sales, Marketing, Dental Service Organizations (DSOs), Commercial Excellence and functional leaders supporting the US commercial organization. Since joining Align in 2013, Mr. Quinn has held several leadership roles throughout the organization. Most recently, he served as the vice president of Marketing, Americas.'}{'symbol': 'GOOGL', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Google Says From July To Sept, Sent Over 12,000 Phishing Warnings To Users In 149 Nations On Being Targeted By Govt-Backed Attackers', 'text': 'Nov 26  - Google <GOOGL.O>::GOOGLE SAYS FROM JULY TO SEPT 2019, CO SENT MORE THAN 12,000 PHISHING WARNINGS TO USERS IN 149 COUNTRIES THAT THEY WERE TARGETED BY GOVERNMENT-BACKED ATTACKERS.GOOGLE SAYS ITS THREAT ANALYSIS GROUP RECENTLY TOOK ACTION AGAINST RUSSIA-AFFILIATED INFLUENCE OPERATIONS TARGETING SEVERAL NATIONS IN AFRICA.GOOGLE SAYS TERMINATED ASSOCIATED GOOGLE ACCOUNTS, 15 YOUTUBE CHANNELS CONNECTED TO RUSSIA-AFFILIATED INFLUENCE OPERATIONS TARGETING AFRICAN NATIONS.GOOGLE SAYS TAG IDENTIFIED CAMPAIGN TARGETING INDONESIAN PROVINCES PAPUA AND WEST PAPUA WITH MESSAGING IN OPPOSITION TO FREE PAPUA MOVEMENT.GOOGLE SAYS TERMINATED 1 ADVERTISING ACCOUNT, 28 YOUTUBE CHANNELS ON CAMPAIGN TARGETING INDONESIAN PROVINCES MESSAGING OPPOSITION TO FREE PAPUA MOVEMENT.'}{'symbol': 'ADI', 'date': '2019-11-26 11:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Analog Devices Sees Q1 2020 Revenue Of $1.3 Bln', 'text': 'ANALOG DEVICES REPORTS FOURTH QUARTER AND FISCAL 2019 RESULTS.SEES Q1 2020 REVENUE $1.3 BILLION.Q4 REVENUE $1.44 BILLION VERSUS REFINITIV IBES ESTIMATE OF $1.45 BILLION.QTRLY DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE $0.74.QTRLY ADJUSTED DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE $1.19.Q4 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $1.22 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.SEES Q1 2020 EPS TO BE $0.61, UP OR DOWN $0.07.SEES Q1 2020 ADJUSTED EPS TO BE $1.00, UP OR DOWN $0.07.Q1 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $1.18, REVENUE VIEW $1.42 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.'}{'symbol': 'ADI', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'The Analog Devices, Inc. Declares Quarterly Cash Dividend, Payable on December 17, 2019', 'text': 'The Analog Devices, Inc. Board of Directors has declared a quarterly cash dividend of $0.54 per outstanding share of common stock. The dividend will be paid on December 17, 2019 to all shareholders of record at the close of business on December 6, 2019.'}{'symbol': 'ANSS', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'ANSYS, Inc. Presents at Nasdaq 41st London Investor Conference, Dec-04-2019 08:15 AM', 'text': 'ANSYS, Inc. Presents at Nasdaq 41st London Investor Conference, Dec-04-2019 08:15 AM. Venue: The May Fair Hotel, London, United Kingdom. Speakers: Ajei S. Gopal, President, CEO & Director.'}{'symbol': 'AAPL', 'date': '2019-11-26 16:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Twitter Says Recently Received Report About Malicious Mobile Software Development Kit Maintained By oneAudience', 'text': "TWITTER SAYS RECENTLY RECEIVED A REPORT ABOUT A MALICIOUS MOBILE SOFTWARE DEVELOPMENT KIT (SDK) MAINTAINED BY ONEAUDIENCE.TWITTER SAYS MALICIOUS SOFTWARE DEVELOPMENT KIT AVAILABLE THROUGH THIRD-PARTY APP STORES MAY HAVE PUT SOME WHO USE TWITTER FOR ANDROID AT RISK.TWITTER SAYS HAVE NO EVIDENCE THAT THE IOS VERSION OF THIS MALICIOUS SDK TARGETED PEOPLE WHO USE TWITTER FOR IOS.TWITTER INC SAYS HAVE INFORMED GOOGLE AND APPLE ABOUT THE MALICIOUS SDK SO THEY CAN TAKE FURTHER ACTION IF NEEDED.TWITTER SAYS SECURITY TEAM HAS DETERMINED 'MALICIOUS SDK' MAY EXPLOIT VULNERABILITY IN MOBILE ECOSYSTEM TO ALLOW PERSONAL INFORMATION TO BE ACCESSED.TWITTER- RECENT 'MALICIOUS ACTIVITY' IS NOT DUE TO VULNERABILITY IN CO’S SOFTWARE, BUT RATHER LACK OF ISOLATION BETWEEN SDKS WITHIN AN APP."}{'symbol': 'AAPL', 'date': '2019-11-26 08:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'India IT Minister Says Expect Apple To Expand Operations In India', 'text': 'INDIA IT MINISTER SAYS EXPECT APPLE TO EXPAND OPERATIONS IN INDIA.INDIA IT MINISTER SAYS ALL APPLE PHONES MADE IN INDIA WILL ALSO BE EXPORTED.INDIA IT MINISTER SAYS APPLE SUPPLIER SALCOMP REACHED AGREEMENT TO TAKE OVER SHUTTERED NOKIA PLANT NEAR CHENNAI.INDIA IT MINISTER SAYS APPLE SUPPLIER SALCOMP WILL MAKE CHARGERS, OTHER COMPONENTS AT PLANT NEAR CHENNAI.INDIA IT MINISTER SAYS 10,000 JOBS TO BE CREATED AT PLANT NEAR CHENNAI.INDIA IT MINISTER SAYS SALCOMP WILL EXPORT 70% OF ALL PRODUCTS, COMPONENTS MADE AT CHENNAI FACILITY.INDIA IT MINISTER SAYS EXPORT OF MOBILE PHONES FROM INDIA WILL BE WORTH $1.6 BILLION AND COMPONENTS EXPORT AT $1.6 BILLION THIS YEAR.INDIA IT MINISTER SAYS SALCOMP TO INVEST 20 BILLION RUPEES AT CHENNAI FACILITY OVER 5 YEARS.'}{'symbol': 'ADSK', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Autodesk, Inc. Provides Earnings Guidance for the Fourth Quarter Ending January 31, 2020 and Fiscal Year 2020', 'text': 'Autodesk, Inc. provided earnings guidance for the fourth quarter ending January 31, 2020 and fiscal year 2020. For the quarter, the company expects revenue to be in the range of $880 million to $895 million and EPS GAAP to be in the range of $0.42 to $0.47.For the fiscal year ending January 31, 2020, the company expects revenue to be in the range of $3,255 million to $3,270 million and EPS GAAP to be in the range of $0.80 to $0.85.'}{'symbol': 'BAX', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Kessler Topaz Meltzer & Check, LLP Files Shareholder Class Action Lawsuit Against Baxter International Inc', 'text': 'The law firm of Kessler Topaz Meltzer & Check, LLP announced that the firm has filed a securities fraud class action lawsuit against Baxter International Inc. on behalf investors who purchased or otherwise acquired Baxter common stock between February 21, 2019 and October 23, 2019, inclusive (the "Class Period"). The complaint alleges that, throughout the Class Period, defendants misrepresented and/or failed to disclose that: (1) certain intra-Company transactions, undertaken for the purpose of generating foreign exchange gains and losses, used foreign exchange rate conventions that were not in accordance with GAAP and enabled intra-company transactions to be undertaken after the related exchange rates were already known; (2) Baxter lacked effective internal control over financial reporting; (3) as a result, Baxter\'s financial statements were misstated and would likely require correction or amendment; (4) due to Baxter\'s internal investigation, it would not be able to file its quarterly report for the period ending September 30, 2019, with the SEC on a Form 10-Q in a timely manner; and (5) as a result of the foregoing, defendants\' statements about Baxter\'s business and operations lacked a reasonable basis.'}{'symbol': 'BBY', 'date': '2019-11-26 10:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Best Buy Co Reports Q3 Earnings Per Share Of $1.10', 'text': 'BEST BUY REPORTS BETTER-THAN-EXPECTED THIRD QUARTER RESULTS.Q3 NON-GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE $1.13.Q3 GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE $1.10.Q3 EARNINGS PER SHARE ESTIMATE $1.03 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.SEES Q4 NON-GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE $2.65 TO $2.75.SEES FY NON-GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE $5.81 TO $5.91.QTRLY ENTERPRISE COMPARABLE SALES INCREASED 1.7%.RAISES FULL-YEAR NON-GAAP DILUTED EPS GUIDANCE RANGE.QTRLY ENTERPRISE REVENUE $9.76 BILLION VERSUS $9.59 BILLION."IN NEAR TERM, WE ARE EXCITED ABOUT OUR HOLIDAY PLANS".SEES FY 2020 ENTERPRISE REVENUE OF $43.2 BILLION TO $43.6 BILLION, VERSUS PRIOR GUIDANCE OF $43.1 BILLION TO $43.6 BILLION.SEES FY 2020 ENTERPRISE COMPARABLE SALES GROWTH OF 1.0% TO 2.0%, VERSUS PRIOR GUIDANCE OF 0.7% TO 1.7%.UPDATED FY20 GUIDANCE REITERATES PRIOR REVENUE EXPECTATIONS AND RAISES NON-GAAP EPS RANGE.UPDATED FY20 GUIDANCE REFLECT STRONG Q3 PROFITABILITY AS WELL AS IMPROVED EXPECTATIONS FOR Q4.OUTLOOK CONTINUES TO INCLUDE BEST ESTIMATE OF IMPACT OF TARIFFS ON GOODS FROM CHINA, BOTH IMPLEMENTED AND PLANNED.FY2020 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $5.74 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.LARGEST QTRLY  COMPARABLE SALES GROWTH DRIVERS WERE APPLIANCES, HEADPHONES, TABLETS, SERVICES AND COMPUTING IN DOMESTIC.QTRLY DOMESTIC ONLINE REVENUE OF $1.40 BILLION INCREASED 15.0% ON A COMPARABLE BASIS PRIMARILY DUE TO HIGHER AVERAGE ORDER VALUES.Q3 REVENUE VIEW $9.70 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.FY2020 REVENUE VIEW $43.38 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.'}{'symbol': 'BBY', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Best Buy Co., Inc. Updates Full-Year Outlook for 2019', 'text': 'Best Buy Co., Inc. updated full-year outlook for 2019. For the year, Enterprise revenue of $43.2 billion to $43.6 billion, which compares to prior guidance of $43.1 billion to $43.6 billion. Enterprise comparable sales growth of 1.0% to 2.0%, which compares to prior guidance of 0.7% to 1.7%.'}{'symbol': 'BIO', 'date': '2019-11-26 20:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Bio Rad Says It Initiated Strategy-Driven Restructuring Plan On November 21', 'text': "BIO RAD LABORATORIES INC SAYS ON NOVEMBER 21, CO INITIATED STRATEGY-DRIVEN RESTRUCTURING PLAN - SEC FILING.BIO RAD LABORATORIES - RESTRUCTURING PLAN INCLUDES WORKFORCE REDUCTION, PRIMARILY IN EUROPE, WHICH CO ANTICIPATES TO BE SUBSTANTIALLY COMPLETED BY END OF Q2 OF 2020.BIO RAD LABORATORIES - ESTIMATES WILL INCUR ABOUT $27 MILLION IN TOTAL COST AS RESULT OF RESTRUCTURING.BIO RAD LABORATORIES SAYS ANTICIPATES THAT IT WILL RECORD MAJORITY OF RESTRUCTURING CHARGES IN Q4 OF 2019.BIO RAD LABORATORIES - EXPECTS SIGNIFICANT PORTION OF NET SAVINGS RESULTING FROM RESTRUCTURING PLAN WILL BE REPURPOSED IN ALIGNMENT WITH CO'S PORTFOLIO STRATEGY."}{'symbol': 'BLK', 'date': '2019-11-26 05:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Jeronimo Martins: BlackRock,Inc Holds 2.02% Voting Rights', 'text': 'SAID ON FRIDAY BLACKROCK,INC NOTIFIED JERONIMO MARTINS THAT IT NOW HOLDS 2.02% VOTING RIGHTS IN THE COMPANY.'}{'symbol': 'BSX', 'date': '2019-11-26 12:30:00-04:56', 'title': "Boston Scientific's Unit And Ontario Municipal Employees Retirement System Entered Into Royalty Purchase Agreement", 'text': "BOSTON SCIENTIFIC CORP - ON NOV 26, UNIT OF CO AND ONTARIO MUNICIPAL EMPLOYEES RETIREMENT SYSTEM ENTERED INTO ROYALTY PURCHASE AGREEMENT.BOSTON SCIENTIFIC CORP - CO'S SUBSIDIARY SOLD TO OMERS 50% OF ROYALTIES PAYABLE IN RESPECT OF WORLDWIDE NET SALES OF ZYTIGA.BOSTON SCIENTIFIC CORP - PURCHASE PRICE FOR SUCH ROYALTY INTERESTS WAS U.S. $256 MILLION IN CASH.BOSTON SCIENTIFIC CORP - TRANSACTION IS EXPECTED TO HAVE NO IMPACT ON BOSTON SCIENTIFIC'S INCOME STATEMENT FOR 2019 AND THEREAFTER.BOSTON SCIENTIFIC CORP - CASH PROCEEDS FROM TRANSACTION ARE EXPECTED TO BE USED PRIMARILY TO PAY DOWN DEBT.BOSTON SCIENTIFIC CORP - TRANSACTION DOES NOT IMPACT BOSTON SCIENTIFIC'S FINANCIAL GUIDANCE FOR 2019 AS ROYALTY BUSINESS WAS DEEMED A PASSIVE BUSINESS."}{'symbol': 'CVX', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Hocol Petroleum Limited agreed to acquire 43% stake in Chuchupa and Ballena fields from Chevron Corporation (NYSE:CVX).', 'text': 'Hocol Petroleum Limited agreed to acquire 43% stake in Chuchupa and Ballena fields from Chevron Corporation (NYSE:CVX) on November 26, 2019. The deal is subject to the approval by Colombian regulators. Jeff Schlegel and Nicholas Rodriguez of Jones Day acted as legal advisors to Chevron Petrolium Company, a subsidiary of Chevron Corporation. Scotia Capital Inc. acted as financial advisor to Chevron Corporation.\n'}{'symbol': 'CB', 'date': '2019-11-26 08:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Chubb Announces Agreement To Purchase Additional 15.3% Of Huatai Insurance Group', 'text': 'CHUBB ANNOUNCES AGREEMENT TO PURCHASE ADDITIONAL 15.3% OF HUATAI INSURANCE GROUP; OWNERSHIP POSITION TO INCREASE TO 46.2%.CHUBB LTD SAYS  CHUBB WILL PURCHASE SHARES FROM INNER MONGOLIA JUNZHENG ENERGY AND CHEMICAL GROUP CO., LTD. AND ONE OF ITS WHOLLY OWNED SUBSIDIARIES.CHUBB -PARTIES ALSO AGREED TO INTENDED TERMS OF A SUBSEQUENT PURCHASE OF AN ADDITIONAL 7.1% OF COMPANY, CONTINGENT UPON COMPLETION OF FIRST PURCHASE.'}{'symbol': 'CVS', 'date': '2019-11-26 19:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Activist Investor Starboard Takes Stake in CVS - WSJ', 'text': ':ACTIVIST INVESTOR STARBOARD VALUE LP HAS TAKEN A STAKE IN CVS HEALTH CORP, HELD TALKS WITH THE DRUGSTORE'}{'symbol': 'DXCM', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'DexCom, Inc. Presents at Piper Jaffray 31st Annual Healthcare Conference, Dec-04-2019 09:30 AM', 'text': 'DexCom, Inc. Presents at Piper Jaffray 31st Annual Healthcare Conference, Dec-04-2019 09:30 AM. Venue: The Lotte New York Palace, 455 Madison Avenue, New York, New York, United States. Speakers: Steven R. Pacelli, Executive Vice President of Strategy & Corporate Development.'}{'symbol': 'DFS', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Discover Financial Services and National Hockey League Extend Partnership', 'text': "Discover Financial Services and the National Hockey League (NHL) reported a multiyear extension of their U.S. partnership that includes Discover maintaining its status as the Official Credit Card of the NHL in the U.S. In addition, the new agreement - which extends beyond credit cards - names Discover the Official Bank of the NHL in the U.S. The expanded partnership also designates Discover as title partner of NBC Sports' Hockey Day in America, a celebration of the impact hockey has had in the United States. Hockey Day in America is set to take place on Sunday, February 16, 2020 with a tripleheader of NHL games on NBC and NBCSN featuring the Pittsburgh Penguins vs. Detroit Red Wings, New York Rangers vs. Boston Bruins and Nashville Predators vs. St. Louis Blues."}{'symbol': 'DLTR', 'date': '2019-11-26 14:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Dollar Tree Says 6 Fewer Selling Days Between Thanksgiving & Christmas To Negatively Impact Q4 Sales - Conf call', 'text': 'EXEC ON Q3 -  WE ESTIMATE THAT OUR COMP WAS NEGATIVELY IMPACTED FROM LOST BALLOON SALES BY ABOUT 20 BASIS POINTS - CONF CALL.EXEC -  WE EXPECT THIS HELIUM SHORTAGE HEADWIND TO CONTINUE, BUT TO A LESSER DEGREE, FOR THE REMAINDER OF 2019.EXEC ON TARIFFS  - NEARLY ALL THE EXPECTED IMPACT IS RELATED TO THE INTRODUCTION OF LIST 4A TARIFFS.EXEC ON Q3 - GROSS PROFIT MARGIN FOR THE DOLLAR TREE SEGMENT DECREASED 60 BASIS POINTS TO 34.2% Y-O-Y.EXEC - THERE WILL BE 6 FEWER SELLING DAYS BETWEEN THANKSGIVING AND CHRISTMAS, WHICH WILL NEGATIVELY IMPACT Q4 SALES.'}{'symbol': 'DLTR', 'date': '2019-11-26 10:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Dollar Tree Posts Q3 Earnings Per Share Of $1.08', 'text': 'DOLLAR TREE, INC. REPORTS RESULTS FOR THE THIRD QUARTER FISCAL 2019.SEES FY 2019 EARNINGS PER SHARE $4.66 TO $4.76.Q3 EARNINGS PER SHARE $1.08.SEES FY 2019 SALES $23.62 BILLION TO $23.74 BILLION.SEES Q4 2019 SALES $6.33 BILLION TO $6.44 BILLION.Q3 SALES $5.75 BILLION VERSUS REFINITIV IBES ESTIMATE OF $5.74 BILLION.Q3 EARNINGS PER SHARE ESTIMATE $1.13 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.SEES Q4 2019 EARNINGS PER SHARE $1.70 TO $1.80 INCLUDING ITEMS.QTRLY ENTERPRISE SAME-STORE SALES INCREASED 2.5%.QTRLY SAME-STORE SALES FOR FAMILY DOLLAR SEGMENT INCREASED 2.3%.QTRLY SAME-STORE SALES FOR DOLLAR TREE SEGMENT INCREASED 2.8%.NOW ESTIMATES SECTION 301 TARIFFS WILL INCREASE COST OF GOODS SOLD BY ABOUT $19 MILLION, OR $0.06 PER SHARE IN Q4 2019.DOLLAR TREE - CONSOLIDATED NET SALES FOR FY 2019 EXPECTED TO BE $23.62 BILLION-$23.74 BILLION VERSUS PREVIOUSLY EXPECTED RANGE OF $23.57 BILLION-$23.79 BILLION.PLANNING FOR MORE THAN 1,000 FAMILY DOLLAR H2 RENOVATIONS FOR FISCAL 2020.SEES LOW SINGLE-DIGIT INCREASE IN SAME-STORE SALES AND 1.1% SELLING SQUARE FOOTAGE GROWTH IN FY 2019.NOW ANTICIPATES EARNINGS PER SHARE FOR FY 2019 WILL RANGE BETWEEN $4.66 AND $4.76.FY EARNINGS PER SHARE OUTLOOK INCLUDES DISCRETE COSTS OF ABOUT $0.28/SHARE AND ABOUT $0.05/SHARE IN STORE CLOSURE RELATED COSTS.FY EARNINGS PER SHARE OUTLOOK INCLUDES ABOUT $0.06/SHARE FROM TARIFFS.FY EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $5.05, REVENUE VIEW $23.70 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.'}{'symbol': 'DLTR', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Dollar Tree, Inc. Revises Consolidated Earnings Guidance for the Fourth Quarter and Full Year of 2019', 'text': 'Dollar Tree, Inc. revised consolidated earnings guidance for the fourth quarter and full year of 2019. For the quarter, the company estimates consolidated net sales in the range from $6.33 billion to $6.44 billion, based on a low single-digit increase in same-store sales for the enterprise. Diluted earnings per share for the quarter, including tariff costs, are estimated to be in the range of $1.70 to $1.80.Consolidated net sales for full-year fiscal 2019 now expected to range from $23.62 billion to $23.74 billion compared to the Company’s previously expected range of $23.57 billion to $23.79 billion. The company now anticipates diluted earnings per share for full-year fiscal 2019 will range between $4.66 and $4.76.'}{'symbol': 'EBAY', 'date': '2019-11-26 20:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Ebay Will Be Entitled To Termination Fee Of $200 Mln If Stubhub Deal Is Terminated', 'text': 'EBAY - WILL BE ENTITLED TO RECEIVE TERMINATION FEE OF $200 MILLION IF STUBHUB DEAL IS TERMINATED UNDER CERTAIN SPECIFIED CIRCUMSTANCES.'}{'symbol': 'EBAY', 'date': '2019-11-26 16:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Viagogo Acquires Stubhub From Ebay For $4.05 Billion', 'text': 'VIAGOGO ACQUIRES STUBHUB FROM EBAY FOR $4.05 BILLION.EBAY INC -  TO SELL STUBHUB TO VIAGOGO FOR A PURCHASE PRICE OF $4.05 BILLION IN CASH.'}{'symbol': 'EMR', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Total EP Denmark Awards Emerson Contract for Monitoring Technology on Tyra Field', 'text': "Total EP Denmark A/S awarded Emerson a contract to provide wellhead pressure monitoring technology to enhance safety during the multi-year redevelopment project to extend the life of Denmark's biggest gas field. The Tyra field in the Danish part of the North Sea has been in production for more than 30 years but is suffering from seabed subsidence. Since production started in the 1980's, the seabed has subsided by more than five meters, reducing the air gap between the sea level and the bottom of the platforms. In order to keep the Tyra field in production, Total EP Denmark is replacing the existing wellhead platforms with new and elevated topsides. The 13-meter-high jacket extensions and new topsides will be installed on top of the existing jacket structures. The Tyra redevelopment project will ensure continuous production from Denmark's biggest gas field, while safeguarding Danish North Sea infrastructure. The $3.3 billion investment in the redevelopment is the biggest ever in the Danish North Sea. Once completed, Tyra is expected to produce more than 200 million barrels of oil equivalent. The current Tyra field has two production complexes, Tyra East and Tyra West, which are linked to satellite fields Harald, Roar, Svend, Tyra Southeast and Valdemar."}{'symbol': 'XOM', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Exxon Mobil Corporation Elects Joseph L. Hooley to its Board of Directors, Effective January 1, 2020', 'text': 'Exxon Mobil Corporation announced that Joseph L. Hooley has been elected to its board of directors, effective Jan. 1, 2020. Hooley currently serves as the non-executive board chairman of State Street Corporation and was its chief executive officer from 2010 to 2018. With the election of Hooley, the ExxonMobil board stands at 11 directors, 10 of whom are non-employee directors. Hooley’s previous experience leading a large global financial services organization, along with operational and risk management expertise, will bring valuable skills to the ExxonMobil board. State Street is one of the world’s leading providers of financial services to institutional investors, including investment servicing, investment management and investment research and trading. Hooley became CEO of State Street in March 2010 and served in the role for eight years. He became board chairman in 2011 and serves as the non-executive chairman until his expected retirement as a director at year-end. He previously served as State Street’s president and chief operating officer. Prior to that, Hooley held several senior management positions at the company. He is a director on the board of Boys & Girls Clubs of Boston and serves as a board director for Liberty Mutual Insurance. He received a bachelor’s degree from Boston College.'}{'symbol': 'FB', 'date': '2019-11-26 16:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Facebook, Twitter Say Hundreds Of Users Accidentally Gave Improper Access To Personal Data Through Third-Party Apps- CNBC', 'text': ':FACEBOOK AND TWITTER SAY HUNDREDS OF USERS ACCIDENTALLY GAVE IMPROPER ACCESS TO PERSONAL DATA THROUGH THIRD'}{'symbol': 'GE', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'ExxonMobil and GE Launch Mobil SHCTM 918 EE gas turbine', 'text': 'ExxonMobil and GE announced the launch of Mobil SHCTM 918 EE gas turbine oil, a new technology that may dramatically improve turbine bearing efficiency by up to 15% compared to conventional ISO VG 32 turbine oils. Designed for use in multi shaft 7HA, 9HA, 6FA.01 and 7FA GE gas turbines, this technology can help power plant operators reduce energy consumption, and, thus, the cost to produce power. Developed in collaboration with GE, this gas turbine oil is the first and only lubricant to meet GEs Energy Efficient GEK 121603 turbine oil specification, which GE developed exclusively for its high-performance turbines. 2019 Global Data Point.'}{'symbol': 'GS', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'GTT Selects Credit Suisse and Goldman Sachs as Financial Advisors for Sale of Infrastructure Division', 'text': 'GTT Communications, Inc. announced that it selected Credit Suisse and Goldman Sachs to act as financial advisors to the company in connection with the potential sale of the Infrastructure Division, which includes the company’s highly differentiated terrestrial pan-European fiber network, subsea transatlantic fiber and data center infrastructure that were part of the Interoute and Hibernia acquisitions.'}{'symbol': 'HAL', 'date': '2019-11-26 06:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Eko Export Extends Deal With Halliburton Till End Of 2020', 'text': 'SIGNS ANNEX TO DEAL WITH HALLIBURTON FOR MICROSPHERE DELIVERY EXTENDING CONTRACT TILL END OF 2020.VALUE OF SAID CONTRACT FOR 2020 TO AMOUNT TO EUR 0.3 MILLION.'}{'symbol': 'HBI', 'date': '2019-11-26 21:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'HanesBrands Announces Process To Appoint New Chief Financial Officer', 'text': 'HANESBRANDS ANNOUNCES PROCESS TO APPOINT NEW CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER.HANESBRANDS INC - CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER BARRY A. HYTINEN HAS NOTIFIED COMPANY OF HIS DECISION TO LEAVE HANES.HANESBRANDS INC - WITH SUPPORT OF AN OUTSIDE SEARCH FIRM, HANES WILL INITIATE A COMPREHENSIVE SEARCH TO FILL CFO ROLE.HANESBRANDS INC - COMPANY WILL CONSIDER BOTH INTERNAL AND EXTERNAL CANDIDATES FOR CFO ROLE.'}{'symbol': 'HPE', 'date': '2019-11-26 19:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'HPE Reports Q4 Non-Gaap Earnings Per Share $0.49 From Continuing Operations', 'text': 'HPE REPORTS FISCAL 2019 FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL-YEAR RESULTS.Q4 REVENUE $7.2 BILLION VERSUS REFINITIV IBES ESTIMATE OF $7.4 BILLION.Q4 NON-GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE $0.49 FROM CONTINUING OPERATIONS.Q4 GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE $0.36 FROM CONTINUING OPERATIONS.Q4 EARNINGS PER SHARE ESTIMATE $0.46 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.QTRLY HYBRID IT REVENUE WAS $5.7 BILLION, WITH 13.8% OPERATING MARGIN, UP 250 BPS YEAR OVER YEAR.MAINTAINS GAAP DILUTED NET EARNINGS PER SHARE OUTLOOK OF $1.01 TO $1.17 FOR FISCAL 2020.MAINTAINS NON-GAAP DILUTED NET EARNINGS PER SHARE OUTLOOK OF $1.78 TO $1.94 FOR FISCAL 2020.SEES Q1 2020 NON-GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE $0.42 TO $0.46.REITERATES FREE CASH FLOW GUIDANCE OF $1.9 TO $2.1 BILLION FOR FISCAL 2020.SEES Q1 2020 GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE $0.20 TO $0.24.FY EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $1.75 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.Q1 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $0.42 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.'}{'symbol': 'HD', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': "YI Technology's Partners with the Home Depot for its Nationwide Black Friday Promotion", 'text': "YI Technology announced its exclusive Black Friday promotion, only available at The Home Depot and HomeDepot.com. Customers nationwide will be able to find YI's best-selling outdoor camera bundled with 6-months of YI Cloud at up to a 40% discount. This Black Friday, Home Depot customers can purchase the consumer tested & trusted YI Outdoor Camera bundled with 6-months of YI Cloud (worth $89) at up to a 40% total discount. Cloud storage provides an extra layer of security customer home. No matter what happens to the camera, the customer's video footage is safe in Silicon Valley-based servers YI provides 128bit end-to-end encryption and is fully GDPR compliant."}{'symbol': 'HRL', 'date': '2019-11-26 10:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Hormel Foods Reports Reports Q4 Earnings Per Share Of $0.47', 'text': 'HORMEL FOODS REPORTS FOURTH QUARTER AND FISCAL 2019 EARNINGS; PROVIDES FISCAL 2020 OUTLOOK.QTRLY  NET SALES OF $2.50 BILLION, DOWN 1%; ORGANIC NET SALES UP 2%.QTRLY DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE OF $0.47.QTRLY VOLUME OF 1.24 BILLION LBS., DOWN 2%; ORGANIC VOLUME UP 1%.QTRLY GROCERY PRODUCTS VOLUME DOWN 9%.QTRLY JENNIE-O TURKEY STORE VOLUME UP 5%.QTRLY GROCERY PRODUCTS NET SALES DOWN 10%.HORMEL FOODS - FY OUTLOOK ASSUMES HIGHER PROTEIN PRICES, FURTHER VOLATILITY RELATED TO IMPACT FROM AFRICAN SWINE FEVER, GLOBAL TRADE UNCERTAINTY.QTRLY JENNIE-O TURKEY STORE NET SALES UP 3%.QTRLY  INTERNATIONAL & OTHER VOLUME DOWN 14%; ORGANIC VOLUME DOWN 13%.QTRLY  INTERNATIONAL & OTHER NET SALES DOWN 12%; ORGANIC NET SALES DOWN 11%.Q4 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $0.46, REVENUE VIEW $2.51 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.SEES FY 2020 NET SALES $9.50 BILLION - $10.30 BILLION.SEES FY 2020 EARNINGS PER SHARE $1.69 - $1.83.EXPECT NEW DRY SAUSAGE PRODUCTION FACILITY TO BE OPERATIONAL IN EARLY FISCAL 2021.FY2020 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $1.76, REVENUE VIEW $9.75 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.HORMEL FOODS - "CONTINUE TO MAKE EXCELLENT PROGRESS ON BURKE PIZZA TOPPINGS PLANT EXPANSION AND PLAN TO START PRODUCTION IN BACK HALF OF FISCAL 2020".HORMEL FOODS - Q4 INTERNATIONAL RESULTS WERE BELOW EXPECTATIONS ON CHALLENGES DUE TO AFRICAN SWINE FEVER, GLOBAL TRADE UNCERTAINTY.'}{'symbol': 'HRL', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Hormel Foods Corporation Provides Earnings Guidance for the Fiscal 2020', 'text': 'Hormel Foods Corporation provided earnings guidance for the fiscal 2020. For the period, the company expects net sales guidance in the range of $9.50 billion to $10.30 billion, earnings per share guidance in the range of $1.69 to $1.83.'}{'symbol': 'HRL', 'date': '2019-11-26 20:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Hormel Foods Announces 11% Increase To Annual Dividend', 'text': 'HORMEL FOODS ANNOUNCES 54TH CONSECUTIVE INCREASE TO ANNUAL DIVIDEND.ANNOUNCES 11 PERCENT INCREASE TO ANNUAL DIVIDEND.SETS QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.2325PER SHARE.'}{'symbol': 'HPQ', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'HP Inc. Provides Earnings Guidance for the First Quarter and Full Year of Fiscal 2020', 'text': 'HP Inc. provided earnings guidance for the first quarter and full year of fiscal 2020. For the fiscal 2020 first quarter, the company estimates GAAP diluted net EPS to be in the range of $0.39 to $0.42.For fiscal 2020, the company estimates GAAP diluted net EPS to be in the range of $2.00 to $2.10.'}{'symbol': 'INTC', 'date': '2019-11-26 20:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Intel Corp Says To Redeem 3.25% Junior Subordinated Convertible Debentures Due 2039', 'text': 'INTEL CORP - INTEL TO REDEEM 3.25% JUNIOR SUBORDINATED CONVERTIBLE DEBENTURES DUE 2039.INTEL CORP - AS OF NOV. 12, 2019, APPROXIMATELY $372 MILLION PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF SECURITIES WAS OUTSTANDING..'}{'symbol': 'INTC', 'date': '2019-11-26 17:30:00-04:56', 'title': "Mediatek Says Dell Expected To Be Among First OEM's To Deliver Intel-Powered Laptops", 'text': "MEDIATEK SAYS PARTNERING WITH INTEL TO BRING MEDIATEK'S 5G MODEM TO PCS.MEDIATEK SAYS FIRST ROLLOUT OF DELL DEVICES POWERED BY INTEL, CO'S 5G SOLUTION EXPECTED FOR EARLY 2021.MEDIATEK SAYS DELL EXPECTED TO BE AMONG FIRST ORIGINAL EQUIPMENT MANUFACTURERS TO DELIVER LAPTOPS POWERED BY INTEL, CO'S 5G SOLUTION."}{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'IBM Services Presents at AI & The Future of Work: Virtual Summit, Dec-04-2019 02:00 PM', 'text': 'IBM Services Presents at AI & The Future of Work: Virtual Summit, Dec-04-2019 02:00 PM. Speakers: Yuval Saban, Associate Partner, Cognitive, Big Data & Analytics.'}{'symbol': 'ISRG', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Intuitive Announces U.S. Food and Drug Administration Clearance of Two Innovative Technologies', 'text': "Intuitive announced U.S. Food and Drug Administration clearance of two innovative technologies for two of the company’s da Vinci®\xa0surgical systems to help improve procedures that require sealing. The company's E-100 generator is its first internally developed robotic generator to power two key instruments on the da Vinci\xa0X®\xa0and Xi™\xa0systems. Vessel Sealer Extend is the instrument in the da Vinci energy sealing portfolio today, and the new SynchroSeal instrument offers enhanced capabilities in general surgery. The E-100 is Intuitive’s first generator and is offered as an upgrade to power Vessel Sealer Extend and SynchroSeal. SynchroSeal will enable a surgeon to perform rapid one-step sealing and transection with a single pedal press.\xa0 SynchroSeal uses advanced bipolar energy from its raised cut electrode to transect tissue then cool down quickly, and will allow surgeons to move on to the next step. With its wristed articulation, its rapid sealing cycle, and refined curved jaw, SynchroSeal offers enhanced versatility to the da Vinci Energy portfolio."}{'symbol': 'IRM', 'date': '2019-11-26 21:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Iron Mountain Announces CFO Transition', 'text': 'IRON MOUNTAIN ANNOUNCES CFO TRANSITION.SAYS BARRY A. HYTINEN APPOINTED CFO.HYTINEN WILL SUCCEED STUART BROWN, WHO WILL BE STEPPING DOWN FROM CFO ROLE ON DECEMBER 31, 2019 TO PURSUE OTHER INTERESTS.BROWN WILL CONTINUE WITH IRON MOUNTAIN IN A CONSULTING ROLE UNTIL FEBRUARY 20, 2020 TO ASSIST WITH TRANSITION.IRON MOUNTAIN - REAFFIRMING PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED GUIDANCE FOR FULL YEAR 2019.HYTINEN CURRENTLY SERVES AS EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER AT HANESBRANDS.'}{'symbol': 'JPM', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'JPMorgan Chase & Co. Expects to Have 17 Branches Open in Greater Boston', 'text': "By the end of December, JPMorgan Chase & Co. expects to have 17 branches open in Greater Boston. Nearly half of them will be in Boston itself, with most of the rest located just outside the city's borders, in places like Dedham and Brookline. There are more Chase branches to come in 2020, as part of the megabank's plans to open 50 retail locations locally within the next few years. But it's starting to look beyond the Hub and its immediate environs. Next year, Chase plans to open locations in Hingham to the south and Woburn and Burlington to the north. That's not a definitive list, but rather those openings that have been revealed publicly by the bank and through filings with federal banking regulators. The Hingham branch, Chase's first on the South Shore, is scheduled to open in mid-February in Derby Street Shops At one point Chase had plans to open a North Quincy branch in 2019. It still plans a location there, though the timing is uncertain, according to Evert. Also, Chase had applied with federal regulators to open a branch in Attleboro on Route 1A, but withdrew the application earlier this month."}{'symbol': 'KEYS', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Keysight Technologies, Inc Provides Revenue Guidance for the First Fiscal Quarter of 2020', 'text': 'Keysight Technologies, Inc. provided revenue guidance for the first fiscal quarter of 2020. For the quarter, the company expected revenue is expected to be in the range of $1.045 billion to $1.065 billion.'}{'symbol': 'LLY', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Lilly Presents Positive New Data from COAST-X, a Phase 3 Study of TALTZ® (ixekizumab) in Patients with Non-Radiographic Axial Spondyloarthritis', 'text': 'Eli Lilly and Company presented detailed results from the COAST-X study at the American College of Rheumatology (ACR)/Association of Rheumatology Professionals (ARP) Annual Meeting in Atlanta as a plenary presentation. COAST-X is a 52-week placebo-controlled Phase 3 study, evaluating the safety and efficacy of TALTZ for the treatment of non-radiographic axial spondyloarthritis (nr-axSpA) in patients with objective signs of inflammation who are biologic disease-modifying anti-rheumatic drug (bDMARD)-naïve. The study showed that TALTZ® (ixekizumab) met the primary and all major secondary endpoints. Axial spondyloarthritis (axSpA) is a chronic inflammatory disease affecting predominantly the sacroiliac joints and the spine skeleton and is estimated to affect 4.5 million adults worldwide. AxSpA is recognized as a single disease entity, with one patient subset defined by the presence of radiographically defined structural damage of the sacroiliac joints (radiographic axSpA or ankylosing spondylitis [AS]) and a second patient subset without clearly detectable structural damage radiographically (nr-axSpA). While these two patient subsets share a similar burden of disease and similar clinical features, such as inflammation in the axial skeleton, which result in chronic inflammatory back pain and fatigue, the biologic treatment options for patients with nr-axSpA are much more limited. A total of 303 adult patients with active nr-axSpA were randomized to receive TALTZ 80 mg subcutaneously every 4 weeks or every 2 weeks (following 80 mg or 160 mg starting dose at Week 0) or placebo. The proportion of patients achieving the primary endpoint of improvement in the signs and symptoms of nr-axSpA as measured by Assessment of Spondyloarthritis International Society 40 (ASAS40) response was superior for TALTZ compared to placebo with statistically significant difference (P<0.01): At Week 16, 35% of patients treated with TALTZ every four weeks and 40% of patients treated with TALTZ every two weeks achieved ASAS40 response, compared to 19% of patients treated with placebo. At Week 52, 30% of patients treated with TALTZ every four weeks and 31% of patients treated with TALTZ every two weeks achieved ASAS40 response, compared to 13% of patients treated with placebo. TALTZ also met the major secondary endpoints in the study at Week 16 and Week 52, including significant improvement in Ankylosing Spondylitis Disease Activity Score (ASDAS), significant improvement in Bath Ankylosing Spondylitis Disease Activity (BASDAI), proportion of patients achieving low disease activity (ASDAS <2.1), significant improvement in sacroiliac joint inflammation as assessed by MRI (week 16) and significant improvement in 36-Item Short Form Health Survey (SF-36) Physical Component Summary (PCS) Score. The overall safety profile of TALTZ was consistent with previously reported results, with no new or unexpected safety findings.'}{'symbol': 'LIN', 'date': '2019-11-26 04:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Linde Signs Memorandum Of Understanding With Baowu Clean Energy In China', 'text': "SIGNED MEMORANDUM OF UNDERSTANDING (MOU) WITH BAOWU CLEAN ENERGY LTD TO COOPERATE TO FURTHER DEVELOP CHINA'S HYDROGEN MARKET.SIGNED MOU WITH BAOWU STEEL GROUP'S NEW SUBSIDIARY."}{'symbol': 'LOW', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': "Lowe's Companies, Inc. Presents at Morgan Stanley Global Consumer & Retail Conference, Dec-04-2019 09:20 AM", 'text': "Lowe's Companies, Inc. Presents at Morgan Stanley Global Consumer & Retail Conference, Dec-04-2019 09:20 AM. Venue: Crowne Plaza Times Square, 1605 Broadway, New York, New York, United States. Speakers: Marvin R. Ellison, President, CEO & Director."}{'symbol': 'LYB', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'LyondellBasell Industries N.V. Presents at Citigroup’s 2019 Basic Materials Conference 2019, Dec-03-2019 11:00 AM', 'text': 'LyondellBasell Industries N.V. Presents at Citigroup’s 2019 Basic Materials Conference 2019, Dec-03-2019 11:00 AM. Venue: The Wagner at the Battery, New York, New York, United States. Speakers: Jim Guilfoyle, executive vice president, Advanced Polymer Solutions & Global Supply Chain.'}{'symbol': 'MAS', 'date': '2019-11-26 11:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Masco Corp Announces $400 Mln Accelerated Share Repurchase', 'text': "MASCO CORPORATION ANNOUNCES $400 MILLION ACCELERATED SHARE REPURCHASE.MASCO CORP - HAS ENTERED INTO AN ACCELERATED SHARE REPURCHASE AGREEMENT WITH ROYAL BANK OF CANADA TO REPURCHASE $400 MILLION OF MASCO'S COMMON STOCK.MASCO CORP - UNDER ASR AGREEMENT, MASCO WILL RECEIVE INITIAL DELIVERY OF 7.3 MILLION SHARES ON NOV 26, 2019.MASCO CORP - THIS AGREEMENT IS PART OF MASCO'S EXISTING SHARE REPURCHASE AUTHORIZATION OF $2 BILLION WHICH WAS ANNOUNCED ON SEPT 17, 2019."}{'symbol': 'MKC', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'McCormick & Company, Incorporated Declares Quarterly Dividend, Payable on January 13, 2020', 'text': 'The Board of Directors of McCormick & Company, Incorporated declared an increase in the quarterly dividend from $0.57 to $0.62 per share on its common stocks, payable January 13, 2020 to shareholders of record December 31, 2019. This marks the 34th consecutive year that the Company has increased its quarterly dividend. At $0.62, the quarterly dividend is double the amount paid in 2012.'}{'symbol': 'MCD', 'date': '2019-11-26 10:30:00-04:56', 'title': "Takeaway.Com Partners With McDonald's In Belgium", 'text': "PARTNERS WITH MCDONALD'S IN BELGIUM.MCDONALD’S ADDED TO CO'S FOOD DELIVERY OFFERING IN BELGIUM.WILL CONTINUE TO INVEST IN THE EXPANSION OF SCOOBER TO MORE CITIES."}{'symbol': 'MRK', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': "Merck Announces the Japan Patent Office and the Intellectual Property Office of Singapore Have Each Allowed the Company's Patent Application for the Use of Paired Crispr Nickases", 'text': "Merck announced that the Japan Patent Office and the Intellectual Property Office of Singapore have each allowed the company's patent application for the use of paired CRISPR nickases, bringing Merck's number of patents to 22 worldwide. These patents cover a foundational CRISPR strategy in which two CRISPR nickases are targeted to a common gene target and work together by nicking or cleaving opposite strands of a chromosomal sequence to create a double-stranded break. This process can optionally include an exogenous or donor sequence for insertion in the same manner as Merck's patented CRISPR integration technology. The requirement of two CRISPR binding events greatly reduces the chances of off-target cutting at other locations in the genome. In addition to Japan and Singapore, Merck has CRISPR-related patents in the following regions: Australia, Canada, China, Europe, Israel, South Korea and the U.S. The company was awarded its first foundational patent in Australia covering CRISPR integration in 2017, and its first U.S. CRISPR patent for proxy-CRISPR in 2019."}{'symbol': 'MSFT', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'AT&T Integrating 5G with Microsoft Cloud to Enable Next-Generation Solutions on the Edge', 'text': 'Microsoft and AT&T are ramping up innovation in the early days of their strategic alliance announced in July. One area of focus is aimed at enabling new 5G, cloud and edge computing solutions to drive enterprise capabilities for companies around the world. The companies are opening select preview availability for Network Edge Compute (NEC) technology, which weaves Microsoft Azure cloud services into AT&T network edge locations closer to customers. This means AT&T\'s software-defined and virtualized 5G core – what the company calls the Network Cloud – is now capable of delivering Azure services. NEC will initially be available for a limited set of select customers in Dallas. Next year, Los Angeles and Atlanta are targeted for select customer availability. From making the world\'s first 5G millimeter wave browsing session on a commercial 5G device to commercial installations in healthcare, manufacturing and entertainment, AT&T has proved itself to be a leader in 5G. The company recently activated an industry-first 400-gigabit connection between Dallas and Atlanta to support video, gaming and other 5G needs. AT&T serves parts of 21 cities with its 5G network using millimeter wave spectrum (5G+) and plans to offer nationwide 5G in the first half of 2020. Microsoft is also helping AT&T Communications become a "public-cloud first" company by migrating most non-network workloads to the public cloud by 2024, and this migration to Azure is already underway. Another important part of AT&T\'s strategy is to empower much of its workforce with Microsoft 365. This includes cloud-connected Office apps on Windows 10, and modern collaboration with Microsoft Teams, SharePoint and OneDrive. AT&T has begun rolling out these solutions to tens of thousands of employees to help drive a culture of modern work. AT&T and Microsoft will have more to share over the coming months and years as this unique alliance continues to evolve and expand. The two companies will both create and adopt new technologies to develop tools, commercial services and consumer applications that benefit everyone.'}{'symbol': 'MS', 'date': '2019-11-26 21:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Morgan Stanley Reports 5.4% Passive Stake In World Wrestling Entertainment Inc As Of November 14', 'text': 'MORGAN STANLEY REPORTS 5.4% PASSIVE STAKE IN WORLD WRESTLING ENTERTAINMENT INC AS OF NOVEMBER 14 - SEC FILING.'}{'symbol': 'NFLX', 'date': '2019-11-26 17:30:00-04:56', 'title': "Netflix Announces Lease Agreement To Keep New York's Paris Theater Open", 'text': "NETFLIX ANNOUNCES A LEASE AGREEMENT TO KEEP NEW YORK'S PARIS THEATER OPEN - STATEMENT.NETFLIX SAYS TERMS OF THE LEASE WERE NOT DISCLOSED - STATEMENT."}{'symbol': 'NEM', 'date': '2019-11-26 21:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Newmont Goldcorp Corp To Sell Red Lake Complex In Ontario, Canada To Evolution Mining Limited', 'text': 'NEWMONT GOLDCORP SUCCESSFULLY REACHES AGREEMENT TO SELL RED LAKE -- $375 MILLION IN CASH PLUS UP TO $100 MILLION IN CONTINGENT PAYMENTS.NEWMONT GOLDCORP CORP - TO SELL RED LAKE COMPLEX IN ONTARIO, CANADA TO EVOLUTION MINING LIMITED.NEWMONT GOLDCORP CORP - CONTINGENT PAYMENT FROM EVOLUTION IS APPLICABLE TO FIRST FIVE MILLION OUNCES OF NEW RESOURCES.'}{'symbol': 'OXY', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Carl Icahn Discloses Plans to Nominate Candidate to the Board of Occidental Petroleum', 'text': 'On November 26, 2019, Carl Icahn announced that he plans to nominate a slate of 10 directors in an attempt to seize control of the board of U.S. oil and gas producer Occidental Petroleum Corp., according to people familiar with the matter. Carl Icahn stated that the Company is the seventh-worst performer in the S&P 500 index this year and on November 8, 2019, in a letter he explained his decision to launch a proxy fight, said the merger made ‘no sense’ to anyone other than Hollub and certain members of the board, who he said ‘grossly overpaid’ for Anadarko to avoid becoming a takeover target themselves. Icahn stated that he has argued, the Company should launch a strategic review, including a potential sale of the combined company, once the Anadarko deal was completed.'}{'symbol': 'PNC', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'PNC Financial Services Corp. Chooses Denver for 5th Niche Office', 'text': "PNC Financial Services Corp. has chosen Denver as its fifth office location for its debt capital markets team. The debt capital markets team supports PNC Bank's corporate banking team, Beiser said. More specifically, team members assist PNC Bank clients with loan syndication, public fixed-income origination, private placements, bridge loan financing, secondary loan trading and agency services. The Denver debt capital markets team will service the western portion of the U.S. along with Texas. PNC Bank's other debt capital markets teams are located in Pittsburgh, Chicago, Philadelphia and Charlotte. Ralph Phillips, who helped launch PNC Bank's Charlotte debt capital markets team back in 2012, has been selected as the managing director of Denver's debt capital markets office."}{'symbol': 'PSA', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Public Storage Announces Redemption of All Outstanding Depositary Shares Representing Interests in Its 5.875% Cumulative Preferred Shares, Series A', 'text': 'Public Storage announced that it is calling for redemption all outstanding depositary shares representing interests in its 5.875% Cumulative Preferred Shares, Series A on December 30, 2019 at $25 per depositary share. The aggregate redemption amount to be paid to all holders of the depositary shares is $190,000,000.'}{'symbol': 'PVH', 'date': '2019-11-26 20:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'PVH Corp Reports Q3 Gaap Earnings Per Share $2.82', 'text': '. REPORTS 2019 THIRD QUARTER RESULTS ABOVE GUIDANCE AND RAISES FULL YEAR OUTLOOK.SEES FY 2019 NON-GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE $9.43 TO $9.45.SEES Q4 2019 NON-GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE $1.77 TO $1.79.SEES FY 2019 GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE $8.04 TO $8.06.SEES Q4 2019 GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE $1.56 TO $1.58.Q3 NON-GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE $3.10.Q3 GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE $2.82.Q3 EARNINGS PER SHARE ESTIMATE $3.00 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.Q3 REVENUE $2.6 BILLION VERSUS REFINITIV IBES ESTIMATE OF $2.54 BILLION.REVENUE IN 2019 IS PROJECTED TO INCREASE APPROXIMATELY 1%.FY REVENUE FOR TOMMY HILFIGER BUSINESS IS PROJECTED TO INCREASE APPROXIMATELY 6%.QTRLY REVENUE IN TOMMY HILFIGER BUSINESS INCREASED 10% TO $1.2 BILLION.FY REVENUE FOR CALVIN KLEIN BUSINESS IS PROJECTED TO DECREASE APPROXIMATELY 2%.QTRLY TOMMY HILFIGER NORTH AMERICA COMPARABLE STORE SALES DOWN 5%.REVENUE IN CALVIN KLEIN BUSINESS FOR QUARTER INCREASED 1% TO $969 MILLION.QTRLY CALVIN KLEIN NORTH AMERICA COMPARABLE STORE SALES DOWN 4%.DURING QUARTER, EXPERIENCED VOLATILITY IN BUSINESSES IN N. AMERICA & ACROSS CHINA, INCLUDING IMPACT OF ONGOING PROTESTS IN HONG KONG.CONTINUING TO TAKE PRUDENT APPROACH TO PLANNING BUSINESS FOR Q4."WE BELIEVE CURRENT HOLIDAY SEASON WILL BE VERY COMPETITIVE AND HIGHLY PROMOTIONAL".FOR REMAINDER OF 2019, EXPECT THAT MACROECONOMIC AND GEOPOLITICAL VOLATILITY CO IS EXPERIENCING GLOBALLY WILL REMAIN A HEADWIND.QTRLY CALVIN KLEIN NORTH AMERICA COMPARABLE STORE SALES FELL 4%.'}{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'S&P Global Announces Expiration of Tender Offer for Any and All of Its Outstanding 3.300% Senior Notes Due 2020 and 6.550% Senior Notes Due 2037 and Redemption of its Outstanding 3.300% Senior Notes Due 2020', 'text': 'S&P Global announced that the previously announced cash tender offer by the Company for any and all of its outstanding 3.300% Senior Notes due 2020 and its 6.550% Senior Notes due 2037, expired on November 25, 2019 at 5:00 p.m., New York City time. The tender offer was made on the terms and subject to the conditions set out in the Offer to Purchase, dated November 19, 2019 and the related Notice of Guaranteed Delivery attached to the Offer to Purchase. The tender offer is referred to as the Offer. The Offer to Purchase and the Notice of Guaranteed Delivery are referred to together as the Offer Documents. According to information provided by D.F. King & Co. Inc., the tender agent and information agent for the Offer, (i) $232,465,000, or 33.21%, of the $700,000,000 aggregate principal amount of the 2020 Notes and (ii) $102,970,000, or 25.74%, of the $400,000,000 aggregate principal amount of the 2037 Notes had been validly tendered and delivered (and not validly withdrawn) in the Offer at or prior to the Expiration Time. In addition, $16,000 aggregate principal amount of 2020 Notes and $429,000 aggregate principal amount of 2037 Notes remain subject to guaranteed delivery procedures. Payment for the Notes purchased pursuant to the Offer is intended to be made on or around November 26, 2019 (the Settlement Date), and payment for the Notes tendered pursuant to a Notice of Guaranteed Delivery and purchased pursuant to the Offer is intended to be made on or around November 29, 2019 (the Guaranteed Delivery Settlement Date). As previously announced, the applicable Tender Offer Consideration will be $1,009.61 for each $1,000 principal amount of 2020 Notes and $1,489.44 for each $1,000 principal amount of 2037 Notes, plus accrued and unpaid interest to, but not including, the Settlement Date, payable on the Settlement Date or the Guaranteed Delivery Settlement Date, as applicable. The Offer will be funded from the net proceeds from the previously announced sale by the Company of its 2.500% Senior Notes due 2029 and 3.250% Senior Notes due 2049 which will be completed on November 26, 2019, immediately prior to the Settlement Date. Goldman Sachs & Co. LLC and Citigroup Global Markets Inc. acted as dealer managers for the Offer. The Company also announced that it intends to redeem all of its outstanding 2020 Notes (CUSIP Nos. 78409V AF1, 78409V AJ3, U75091 AC9) that are not purchased pursuant to the Offer at a redemption price equal to the outstanding principal amount of the 2020 Notes plus a make-whole premium determined in accordance with the terms of the Notes, plus accrued and unpaid interest thereon, to, but not including, the redemption date. The redemption date will be December 26, 2019.'}{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2019-11-26 18:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'S&P Global Prices Tender Offer Of Its Outstanding 3.300% Senior Notes Due 2020', 'text': 'S&P GLOBAL ANNOUNCES PRICING OF TENDER OFFER FOR ANY AND ALL OF ITS OUTSTANDING 3.300% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2020 AND 6.550% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2037.S&P GLOBAL - EXPECTS SETTLEMENT DATE TO OCCUR ON NOV 26, 2019.'}{'symbol': 'CRM', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'City of Chicago Transforms its 311 System with Catalyst Consulting Group and Salesforce', 'text': 'Catalyst Consulting Group announced that it has collaborated with the City of Chicago to transform its legacy non-emergency 311 system by bringing it into the cloud with Salesforce.'}{'symbol': 'SEE', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Sealed Air Corporation Issues $425 Million Aggregate Principal Amount of 4.000% Senior Notes Due 2027', 'text': 'Sealed Air Corporation, and U.S. Bank National Association, as trustee, entered into an Indenture dated as of November 26, 2019, pursuant to which Sealed Air issued $425 million aggregate principal amount of 4.000% senior notes due 2027. The Notes will mature on December 1, 2027. Interest is payable on December 1 and June 1 of each year, commencing June 1, 2020. Prior to the date that is three months prior to the scheduled maturity date of the Notes (the “Par Call Date”), Sealed Air may redeem the Notes, in whole or in part, at any time, upon not less than 30 nor more than 60 days’ notice, at a redemption price equal to the greater of (i) 100% of the principal amount of such Notes or (ii) the sum of the present values of the remaining scheduled payments of principal and interest on such Notes (assuming for this purpose that interest accrued to the Par Call Date is scheduled to be paid on the Par Call Date) from the redemption date to the Par Call Date discounted to the redemption date on a semiannual basis (assuming a 360-day year consisting of twelve 30-day months) at the Treasury Rate (as defined in the Indenture) plus 50 basis points, plus in either (i) or (ii), any interest accrued but not paid to the date of redemption (subject to the right of holders of record on the relevant record date to receive interest due on the relevant interest payment date). At any time on or after the Par Call Date, Sealed Air may redeem the Notes, in whole or in part, at any time, upon not less than 30 nor more than 60 days’ notice, at a redemption price equal to 100% of the principal amount thereof, plus any interest accrued but not paid to, but not including, the date of redemption (subject to the right of holders of record on the relevant record date to receive interest due on the relevant interest payment date). The Indenture limits the ability of Sealed Air and, in certain cases, its Restricted Subsidiaries (as defined in the Indenture) to, among other things, (i) create liens on certain assets to secure indebtedness; (ii) engage in certain sale and leaseback transactions; and (iii) merge or consolidate or transfer and sell substantially all of their assets. The Indenture provides that events of default with respect to the Notes include: (i) failure to make the payment of any interest on any Note when the same becomes due, with such failure continuing for a period of 30 days; (ii) failure to make the payment of any principal of, or premium, if any, on, any Note when the same becomes due; (iii) failure to perform or comply with certain covenants or agreements in the Notes, the Indenture or related documents (subject to applicable time periods provided for compliance or cure); (iv) failure to pay when due (subject to any applicable grace period) the principal of, or acceleration of, any Indebtedness (as defined in the Indenture) for money borrowed by Sealed Air or any Restricted Subsidiary having an aggregate principal amount of at least $75.0 million and such default shall not have been received or such Indebtedness shall not have been discharged within 10 days; and (v) certain events of bankruptcy, insolvency or reorganization affecting Sealed Air or any Restricted Subsidiary that is a Significant Subsidiary (as defined in the Indenture).'}{'symbol': 'SYK', 'date': '2019-11-26 19:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Stryker Announces Pricing Of €2.4 Billion Senior Notes Offering', 'text': "STRYKER ANNOUNCES PRICING OF €2.4 BILLION SENIOR NOTES OFFERING.STRYKER CORP - PRICED SENIOR NOTES OF EUR 850 MILLION AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF COMPANY'S 0.25% NOTES DUE 2024.STRYKER CORP - ALSO PRICED SENIOR NOTES: EUR 800 MILLION AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF COMPANY'S 0.75% NOTES DUE 2029.STRYKER CORP - ALSO PRICED SENIOR NOTES OF EUR 750 MILLION OF COMPANY'S 1.00% NOTES DUE 2031."}{'symbol': 'TEL', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'TE Connectivity Announces SWFR Single Wall Heat Shrink Tubing', 'text': "TE Connectivity manufactures SWFR single wall heat shrink tubing which is a cost effective, highly flame-retardant, 2:1 shrink ratio tubing made of irradiated, cross-linked polyolefin. It insulates and mechanically protects components, electrical connections, terminations and more. This non-halogenated tubing is applicable for use in enclosed spaces, and it fully recovers at a relatively low 90°C, facilitating rapid application. Offered in two flexible types, X2 is a thin wall tubing and X4 is a very thin wall tubing. Both types are halogen free, permitting their use in enclosed spaces where toxic gasses from burning materials containing halogens are undesirable. SWFR heat shrink tubing's high degree of flame retardancy allows it to carry UL VW-1 and CSA OFT. TE’s SWFR single wall heat shrink tubing is highly flame-retardant, it is an excellent candidate for applications in appliances, motor vehicles, commercial electronics, and consumer electronics given the increased focus on consumer safety. It is environmentally friendly and emits minimal amounts of toxic or acidic gasses when burned, making it appropriate for use in enclosed areas. It electrically insulates and mechanically protects components and other electrical connections and terminations. Low shrink temperature permits quick installation and reduces the risk of damage to temperature-sensitive components. The X2 thin wall version shrinks quickly, and the X4 very thin wall version can shrink more than twice as fast as the X2. With sizes from 0.8 to 30mm and two different wall thicknesses, this very flexible tubing is suitable for use in a range of applications. New marked versions allow for easy identification. As an authorized distributor for TE Connectivity, Heilind Asia provides TE’s products and also value added services. Heilind Asia supports both original equipment and contract manufacturers in all market segments of the electronics industry, stocking products from the industry’s leading manufacturers in 25 component categories, with a particular focus on interconnect, electromechanical, fastener/hardware and sensor products."}{'symbol': 'TMO', 'date': '2019-11-26 19:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Maggie Yuen Appointed Chief Financial Officer Of Penumbra', 'text': 'MAGGIE YUEN APPOINTED CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER OF PENUMBRA.PENUMBRA INC -  SRI KOSARAJU WILL CONTINUE IN HIS ROLE AS PRESIDENT.PENUMBRA INC - MOST RECENTLY, YUEN WAS AT THERMO FISHER SCIENTIFIC INC.PENUMBRA INC - APPOINTMENT OF MAGGIE YUEN AS CFO OF CO, EFFECTIVE DECEMBER 2, 2019.'}{'symbol': 'TWTR', 'date': '2019-11-26 16:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Facebook, Twitter Say Hundreds Of Users Accidentally Gave Improper Access To Personal Data Through Third-Party Apps- CNBC', 'text': ':FACEBOOK AND TWITTER SAY HUNDREDS OF USERS ACCIDENTALLY GAVE IMPROPER ACCESS TO PERSONAL DATA THROUGH THIRD'}{'symbol': 'TYL', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Former Employees of Tyler Technologies File Complaint for Unpaid Overtime', 'text': 'On November 20, 2019, a former employee (Plaintiff) of Tyler Technologies ("Tyler") filed a class and collective action lawsuit (3:19-cv-07647) against the company to recover unpaid overtime wages. Plaintiff and other similarly-situated employees worked as Implementation Consultants and Implementation Coordinators ("Implementation Reps") for Tyler and were all paid a salary. Plaintiff alleges that Tyler violated the wage and hour provisions of the Fair Labor Standards Act ("FLSA") by intentionally misclassifying him and other Implementation Reps as salaried employees and as a result, were denied overtime wages. Plaintiff alleges that he and other Implementation Reps routinely worked more than forty (40) hours per week without receiving "time-and-a-half" their regular rate of pay for all hours worked over forty (40) in a workweek.'}{'symbol': 'USB', 'date': '2019-11-26 18:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Foreside Announces Agreement To Acquire Fund Distributor Quasar Distributors', 'text': "FORESIDE ANNOUNCES AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE FUND DISTRIBUTOR QUASAR DISTRIBUTORS, LLC.FORESIDE FINANCIAL - TO ACQUIRE U.S. BANCORP'S MUTUAL FUND AND ETF DISTRIBUTION BUSINESS, QUASAR DISTRIBUTORS."}{'symbol': 'UNH', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'UnitedHealthcare to Open 14 Medicare Services Centers At Walgreens', 'text': "UnitedHealthcare has teamed up with Walgreens to open 14 Medicare services centers. Under a multi-year deal, the stores will be opened within Walgreens stores in five metropolitan areas. Walgreens is also collaborating with UnitedHealthcare's new AARP Medicare Advantage Walgreens plans to deliver lower prescription drug costs and convenient access to medications. The companies will begin to open the Medicare services centers in January 2020 at Walgreens stores in the Las Vegas, Phoenix, Cleveland, Denver and Memphis markets. The services centers will help Walgreens customers to know more about Medicare, meet service advocates to discuss UnitedHealthcare plan benefits and even enroll in plans. Further, through HouseCalls program, UnitedHealthcare Medicare Advantage members can make an appointment for an in-store annual wellness visit at Walgreens services centers. Walgreens in September collaborated with health and weight loss management services provider Jenny Craig to open 100 Jenny Craig at Walgreens locations nationwide in January 2020. Jenny Craig will offer its clinically proven program featuring private one-on-one consultations, a customized menu plan and meal delivery to Walgreens customers."}{'symbol': 'VLO', 'date': '2019-11-26 19:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Valero Announces Long-Term Agreements For Three Additional Refined Product Terminals In Mexico', 'text': 'VALERO ANNOUNCES LONG-TERM AGREEMENTS FOR THREE ADDITIONAL REFINED PRODUCT TERMINALS IN MEXICO.VALERO MARKETING AND SUPPLY DE MÉXICO - GUADALAJARA TERMINAL IS EXPECTED TO HAVE ABOUT 900,000 BARRELS OF STORAGE CAPACITY.VALERO MARKETING AND SUPPLY DE MÉXICO - MONTERREY TERMINAL IS EXPECTED TO HAVE ABOUT 425,000 BARRELS OF STORAGE CAPACITY.VALERO MARKETING AND SUPPLY DE MÉXICO - THREE NEW REFINED PRODUCT TERMINALS ARE EXPECTED TO START OPERATIONS IN 2021 IN MEXICO.VALERO MARKETING AND SUPPLY DE MÉXICO - GUADALAJARA, MONTERREY TERMINALS TO BE CONSTRUCTED IN SEPARATE JV WITH NO CASH CONTRIBUTIONS FROM VALERO.'}{'symbol': 'VZ', 'date': '2019-11-26 15:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'LICT Announces Sale Of Its Interest In MODOC RSA Limited Partnership To Verizon', 'text': 'ANNOUNCES SALE OF ITS INTEREST IN MODOC RSA LIMITED PARTNERSHIP TO VERIZON.LICT WILL RECEIVE ITS REGULAR PARTNERSHIP DISTRIBUTIONS FOR PERIOD THROUGH DEC 31.AGREEMENT TO SELL ITS MINORITY INTEREST IN MODOC RSA LIMITED PARTNERSHIP TO VERIZON WIRELESS.'}{'symbol': 'VIAC', 'date': '2019-11-26 16:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'CBS And Viacom Announce Expected Closing Date Of Merger', 'text': 'CBS CORPORATION AND VIACOM INC. ANNOUNCE EXPECTED CLOSING DATE OF MERGER.VIACOM INC - VIACOMCBS TRANSACTION EXPECTED TO CLOSE ON DECEMBER 4.VIACOM INC - TRADING OF VIACOMCBS ON NASDAQ EXPECTED TO BEGIN DECEMBER 5.VIACOM INC - AS PART OF LISTING, VIACOMCBS WILL ALSO BECOME ELIGIBLE FOR FUTURE INCLUSION IN NASDAQ 100 INDEX.VIACOM INC - CBS, CO ANNOUNCE THEIR PENDING MERGER IS CURRENTLY EXPECTED TO CLOSE ON DEC 4.VIACOM INC -  VIACOMCBS INC EXPECTED TO BEGIN TRADING ON NASDAQ UNDER NEW TICKER SYMBOLS "VIACA" AND "VIAC".'}{'symbol': 'WFC', 'date': '2019-11-26 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Wells Fargo & Company has completed a Fixed-Income Offering in the amount of $34.362 million.', 'text': 'Wells Fargo & Company has completed a Fixed-Income Offering in the amount of $34.362 million.\n\nSecurity Name: Step-Up Senior Unsecured Notes due November 29, 2022\nSecurity Type: Corporate Bond/Note (Non Convertible)\nPrincipal Amount: $34.362 million\nPrice\\Range: 100%\nDiscount Per Security: 0.4%\nSecurity Features: Callable; MTN\nCoupon Type: Step-Up\n'}